	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/ray_tracing/look/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Faithful keeps each place as bright as the game's lightmaps made it. Remix lights it by the traced lamps, sun and sky alone, with its own exposure and highlights."/>
		<string text="How closely each region of the traced light is held to the game's lightmaps. Style's: Full for Faithful, None for Remix."/>
		<string text="Fixed: the game's. Game's: follows the traced light, keeping the frame as bright as the game's. Auto: adapts freely, as an eye does. The same setting as PRISM's lightings' Exposure."/>
		<string text="How light past white is drawn. Filmic rolls it off; Local also keeps a dark room readable beside a sunlit doorway. Needs HDR drawing. The same setting as PRISM's lightings' Tone Curve."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Lights: the panels and lamps the level was lit by light it again. All Glows: screens and glowing parts too."/>
		<string text="The lamps' brightness against the brightness fitted to the game's lightmaps."/>
		<string text="The sun's disc its shadows' edges soften by: the sky's own, the real sun's, or a softer one."/>
		<string text="Surfaces': bounced light takes the colour of what it bounces off. Grey: one grey for all."/>
		<string text="How often light bounces before the cache takes over. By Quality: 1 at Low and Medium, 2 at High, 3 at Ultra."/>
	</strings>
